### ==================== 搜索测试 ====================
# 不需要 token，LoginFilter 放行 /search



### ==================== IdSearch — 从数据库按 contentId 查 ====================

### 1. IdSearch — 正常查询存在的 content
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}


### 2. IdSearch — 查询不存在的 content
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 99999
}


### 3. IdSearch — contentId 为 0
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 0
}


### 4. IdSearch — JSON 中缺少 contentId 字段
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=IdSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ==================== keywordSearch — 全文搜索 ====================

### 5. keywordSearch — 正常搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "红烧肉"
}


### 6. keywordSearch — 搜索另一个关键词
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "太刀"
}


### 7. keywordSearch — 搜索不存在的关键词（应返回空列表）
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "xyz不存在的关键词123"
}


### 8. keywordSearch — keyword 为空字符串
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": ""
}


### 9. keywordSearch — keyword 全是空格
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "   "
}


### 10. keywordSearch — 缺少 keyword 字段
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=keywordSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ==================== getDetail — 从缓存按 contentId 取详情 ====================

### 11. getDetail — 正常从缓存获取
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=getDetailRecommended
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}


### 12. getDetail — 缓存中不存在的 contentId
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=getDetailRecommended
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 99999
}


### ==================== 异常路径 ====================

### 13. 未识别的 action
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search?action=unknownAction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}


### 14. 缺少 action 参数
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "test"
}
